		(property "Description" "Operating voltage range:  VCC range: 2.7V to 5.5V  Logic pins compatible with 1.8V, 3.3V, and 5V  4 constant current sinks with high precision:  0.1mA to 51mA per current sink  Device-to-device error: max +/-5%  Channel-to-channel error: max +/-5%  Ultra-low headroom voltage: 110mV (typ.) at 25.5mA; 210mV (typ.) at 51mA  PWM phase shift configurable for each LED  Ultra-low power consumption:  Standby: ISTB = 26uA (typical) when CHIP_EN = 0 (data retained)  Active: INOR = 0.4mA (typical"
